## Context Monitoring and Optimization

### Performance Metrics

- Context assembly time
- Token utilization efficiency
- Relevance score distribution
- User satisfaction with context quality

### Optimization Strategies

- Cache frequently accessed context
- Pre-compute relevance scores
- Optimize search algorithms
- Implement context compression

### Continuous Improvement

- Learn from context usage patterns
- Adapt to user feedback
- Optimize based on task success rates
- Refine relevance scoring algorithms

## Context Security and Privacy

### Information Classification

- Public: General project information
- Internal: Development patterns and decisions
- Confidential: User-specific preferences
- Restricted: Security-related information

### Access Control

- Respect user privacy in context assembly
- Secure storage of sensitive context
- Regular security audits
- Compliance with data protection regulations

### Context Sanitization

- Remove sensitive information when needed
- Anonymize user-specific data
- Filter out confidential details
- Maintain context utility while protecting privacy
